# 1. INFRASTRUCTURE IS PART OF THE PRODUCT

The repository currently declares infrastructure equivalent to:

```yaml
services:

  postgres:
    image: postgres:17-alpine

  valkey:
    image: valkey/valkey:8-alpine

  minio:
    image: minio/minio:latest

  victoriametrics:
    image: victoriametrics/victoria-metrics:latest

  loki:
    image: grafana/loki:latest

```

These containers MUST NOT merely exist.

Every service must have:

```text
clear responsibility
canonical owner
configuration contract
runtime adapter
health/readiness behavior
failure semantics
tests
documentation
production guidance

```

The final infrastructure ownership must become approximately:

```text
PostgreSQL
    ↓
@moon/orm
    ↓
Moon Server models / transactions / migrations


Valkey
    ↓
Moon cache/runtime adapter
    ↓
cache / distributed coordination / rate-limit / optional session support


MinIO
    ↓
Moon storage adapter
    ↓
attachments / blobs / files / generated artifacts


VictoriaMetrics
    ↑
Moon Server /metrics
    ↑
application + runtime metrics


Loki
    ↑
structured application logs
    ↑
Moon Server logging pipeline

```

Do NOT leave infrastructure disconnected.

Do NOT connect a service merely for the sake of saying it is integrated.

Integrate only through explicit responsibilities.

