# 102. TARGET DOCKER CONNECTIONS

Inside Compose network:

```text
Moon Server
    ├── postgres:5432
    ├── valkey:6379
    └── minio:9000

```

Monitoring pipeline:

```text
Moon Server /metrics
    → Alloy
    → VictoriaMetrics

Moon Server structured logs
    → Alloy
    → Loki

```

Do not route container traffic through host-bound `127.0.0.1` ports.

