# 115. DEFINITION OF DONE V3

Moon Server V3 consolidation is DONE only when this statement is accurate:

> MoonWitness is an application composed on top of a reusable Moon Server runtime. Moon Server owns transport, authentication, generic REST, explicit RPC, realtime transport where actually supported, addon lifecycle, request context, infrastructure facades, health and observability instrumentation. Moon ORM owns relational persistence through PostgreSQL. Valkey provides explicitly defined ephemeral/shared runtime capabilities rather than becoming a second database and can be optional when those capabilities are disabled. MinIO provides S3-compatible object storage behind a Moon storage abstraction with PostgreSQL metadata and Moon authorization, and is required only when storage capabilities are enabled. Moon Server exposes meaningful bounded Prometheus-compatible metrics; Grafana Alloy is the preferred single self-hosted collector that actually forwards those metrics into VictoriaMetrics and ships structured redacted logs into Loki. VictoriaMetrics is metrics-only, Loki is logs-only, Grafana is optional UI, and distributed tracing/OpenTelemetry/Tempo are not mandatory for V3 unless the repository already has a real, validated consumer. Domain addons remain independent of Fastify and infrastructure SDKs. Ordinary HTTP requests never execute implicitly as superuser. Backend and infrastructure behavior are protected by automated tests and CI. Docker Compose is validated and actual runtime resource consumption is measured rather than assumed.

Anything less means the migration is still in progress.
---

# 116. FINAL INFRASTRUCTURE NORTH STAR

Keep this model throughout implementation:

```text
                           Moon Server
                               │
            ┌──────────────────┼───────────────────┐
            │                  │                   │
            ▼                  ▼                   ▼
         Moon ORM         Moon Cache         Moon Storage
            │                  │                   │
            ▼                  ▼                   ▼
        PostgreSQL           Valkey              MinIO
                           optional/            optional/
                           capability           capability


                           Moon Server
                               │
                    ┌──────────┴──────────┐
                    │                     │
                    ▼                     ▼
                 /metrics          Structured JSON Logs
                    │                     │
                    └──────────┬──────────┘
                               ▼
                          Grafana Alloy
                           │         │
                           ▼         ▼
                  VictoriaMetrics   Loki
                     METRICS        LOGS

Optional later:

Moon Server / OpenTelemetry
        ↓
      Alloy
        ↓
 trace backend such as Tempo
```

And:

```text
PostgreSQL
= durable relational source of truth

Valkey
= ephemeral/shared runtime acceleration and coordination

MinIO
= durable binary/object storage when storage is enabled

Grafana Alloy
= collection/shipping layer for operational signals

VictoriaMetrics
= operational metrics backend

Loki
= centralized structured log backend

Grafana
= optional dashboard UI

OpenTelemetry / Tempo
= optional future tracing path, not a V3 core requirement
```

Never blur these responsibilities without a strong architectural reason.
